            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "PRO.8.15"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Awa 8:15",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Kituritete EJAKAIT Ekonideke loeyalamikin kanukon adakakin; oicoloŋ loka Isirael: naarai abu EJAKAIT komina Isirael ikar kere. Ŋes kituluoria jo ekabaka, aiswamaenen nukabeit ka nuedolito.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.10.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.10.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 10:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Koinak ŋesi ckabaka esabu atalatan akwatat ka akaisaarci, ka luewuru maa luipu noi noi, ka amor da nuka akais nuipu: mam eyauna bobo luewuru maa luipu lueriakas kanul luainakini Akabaka naka Seba ekabaka Solomon.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.10.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.10.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
